{"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/worldmodule"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","anchor":"Overview","level":2,"text":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"WorldModule is built around a ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":", a value that holds everything your game or simulation","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"knows. The world organizes that state with a few simple ideas:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"An "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"entity"}]},{"type":"text","text":" is one thing in the world, such as a ball, a player or a particle. It has no data"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"of its own; you refer to it by its handle, an "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Entity","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"component"}]},{"text":" is a plain value that an entity holds, such as a position or a health total.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Any type that conforms to ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Component"},{"text":" can be a component, and an entity holds at most one","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"component of each type.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"resource","type":"text"}]},{"text":" is a value the world holds once, outside any entity, such as a clock or a score.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Any type that conforms to ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Resource","type":"reference"},{"text":" can be a resource.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The examples throughout this module’s documentation use these components:"}]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["struct Position: Component { var x: Double, y: Double }","struct Velocity: Component { var dx: Double, dy: Double }","struct Health: Component { var current: Int }","struct Frozen: Component {}","struct Name: Component, Hashable { var value: String }"]},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Spawn-Entities-and-Work-with-Their-Components","level":3,"text":"Spawn Entities and Work with Their Components"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Spawn an entity with the components it starts with. The world returns the entity’s handle, which"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"you use to read and change its components:"}]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["var world = World()","let hero = world.spawn(Name(value: \"Ada\"), Position(x: 0, y: 0), Health(current: 100))","","world[Health.self, of: hero].current -= 30","world.insert(Velocity(dx: 1, dy: 0), into: hero)","world.remove(Position.self, from: hero)","","print(world[Health.self, of: hero].current)","\/\/ Prints \"70\""]},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Query-and-Update-Many-Entities","level":3,"text":"Query and Update Many Entities"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Most of the work in a game applies to every entity that holds some set of components: every"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"entity with a position and a velocity moves, every entity with health can take damage. A query"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"visits those entities and reads their components, and an update changes one component of each in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"place:"}]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["var world = World()","world.spawn(Position(x: 0, y: 0), Velocity(dx: 1, dy: 0))","world.spawn(Position(x: 5, y: 5), Velocity(dx: 0, dy: -1), Frozen())","","world.update(Position.self, reading: Velocity.self, where: .without(Frozen.self)) { position, row in","    position.x += row.components.dx","    position.y += row.components.dy","}","","var coordinates: [(Double, Double)] = []","for (_, position) in world.query(Position.self) {","    coordinates.append((position.x, position.y))","}","print(coordinates)","\/\/ Prints \"[(1.0, 0.0), (5.0, 5.0)]\""]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Filters such as ","type":"text"},{"code":".without(Frozen.self)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" narrow which entities a query or update visits. To learn","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"more, see ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/QueryingAWorld","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Defer-Structural-Changes-with-Commands","level":3,"text":"Defer Structural Changes with Commands"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"While a query or update is visiting entities, you can’t spawn or despawn entities or add and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"remove their components. Record those changes in "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Commands"},{"type":"text","text":" instead, and apply them when the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"visit is over:"}]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["var world = World()","world.spawn(Health(current: 0))","world.spawn(Health(current: 40))","","var commands = Commands()","for (entity, health) in world.query(Health.self) where health.current <= 0 {","    commands.despawn(entity)","}","world.apply(commands)","","print(world.count)","\/\/ Prints \"1\""]},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Keep-World-Wide-State-in-Resources","level":3,"text":"Keep World-Wide State in Resources"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A resource holds state that belongs to the whole world rather than to any entity:"}]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["struct Elapsed: Resource { var seconds: Double }","","var world = World()","world.resources.insert(Elapsed(seconds: 0))","world.resources[Elapsed.self].seconds += 0.5","","print(world.resources[Elapsed.self].seconds)","\/\/ Prints \"0.5\""]},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Copy-Worlds-Freely","level":3,"text":"Copy Worlds Freely"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A world is a value: assigning it to another variable makes an independent copy. Copies share"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"storage until one of them changes, so copying is cheap, and keeping an earlier state for undo, a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"replay or a comparison takes one assignment."}]}]}],"sections":[],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule"},"kind":"symbol","metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"WorldModule"}],"title":"WorldModule","externalID":"WorldModule","symbolKind":"module","roleHeading":"Framework","role":"collection"},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Entity","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Component","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Resource"],"anchor":"Essentials","title":"Essentials"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Bundle","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/BundleBuilder","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/TupleBundle","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/EitherBundle"],"anchor":"Grouping-Components","title":"Grouping Components"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/QueryingAWorld","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Query","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/QueryView","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/EntityQueryView","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/QueryRow","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/QueryTerm","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/AnyOf","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/EntitiesView"],"anchor":"Querying-and-Updating-Entities","title":"Querying and Updating Entities"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/QueryFilter","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/FilterTerm","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/With","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Without","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Added","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Changed","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Allows"],"anchor":"Filtering-Queries","title":"Filtering Queries"},{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Groups are made with "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"group(_:)"},{"type":"text","text":", cached queries with "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"cache(_:)"},{"type":"text","text":" and indexes by value with"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"index(_:)"},{"type":"text","text":" on "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"; "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"lookup(_:)"},{"type":"text","text":" finds the entities holding a value, and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"lookup(_:equals:)"},{"type":"text","text":" the entities whose property at a key path equals one."}],"identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/GroupError"],"